  },
  "colorCalibrationsDescription": "Start values for the seven calibration sliders of an unedited raw file, applied only with the setting that matches colors to the camera model. colorCalibrationDefault is fitted over all reference pictures of all cameras; an entry in colorCalibrations replaces it completely and exists only where it matched held-out pictures of that model better than the default."
